 bout 2.5 hours.\n\nTrain cost is £4.60 return (cheaper than a single)\n\nM
 aybe a drink at the end if people fancy it.\n\nLiRF: Sim Buzzard [Phone Num
 ber Redacted]\n\n10 miles in 2.5 hours target time.\n\nView on Strava: http
