 30 we will head to the Beacon on the ridge and enjoy the Winter solstice su
 nrise before continuing to End Hill and then looping back along Alice Bette
 ridge walk before going back to the start. This is about 10.5 k and I expec
 t us to be out about 1.75 to 2 hours. We will walk hills and muster as need
 ed to accomodate all.If you want to leave a car at Clock Tower and do a hal
 f way then let me know as we can probably sort a shuttle.Optional coffee af
 terwards if anywhere open (I will research and update).LiRF: Sim Buzzard [P
 hone Number Redacted]Head torch advised as a bit dark when we start.View on
